{
  "source": "Chaplin, Bearman, Huera Huarte & Pattenden (2005a), Journal of Fluids and Structures 21(1), 3-24 (the riser, Sec. 2; the drag amplification, Eq. 4); Chaplin, Bearman, Cheng, Fontaine, Graham, Herfjord, Huera Huarte, Isherwood, Lambrakos, Larsen, Meneghini, Moe, Pattenden, Triantafyllou & Willden (2005b), Journal of Fluids and Structures 21(1), 25-40 (the blind-trial cases); the authors' presentation of the blind trial, 'Blind predictions of laboratory measurements of vortex-induced vibrations of a tension riser', Trondheim, October 2004 (the measured results); the project's pages at the University of Southampton, archived by the Internet Archive (mechanical properties, current zone)",
  "doi": [
    "10.1016/j.jfluidstructs.2005.04.010",
    "10.1016/j.jfluidstructs.2005.05.016"
  ],
